{"v":4,"catch":"準備玩 ？","desc":"歡迎參加終極的Head Games競賽！\n您有僅用頭部射擊就能在足球，排球或籃球比賽中擊敗對手的能力嗎？ Head Games是一款激烈而令人興奮的遊戲，您可以在其中與朋友或AI對抗。您可以選擇多個角色，唯一的目標就是嘗試擊球並在對手的網中得分。您也可以與朋友一起玩。\n您可以成為Head Games中的終極玩家嗎？嘗試遊戲，讓自己沉浸在終極遊戲體驗中。\n特徵：\n•踢足球，籃球或排球\n•輸入1v1或2v2遊戲並贏\n•激烈，動感十足的遊戲玩法\n•絕佳的復古視覺效果","publisher":"Piotr Skalski","release":"2021-06-03","genres":["運動","派對","街機"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/083f8cc8b3d60126cc25cf965b756a00005efeb2545acde86dc2ed10d4b5993e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3af4cefe6e6b36365ee99600c1e63ceeeba06609129b39cde201c75c6415048d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/14d0ba8135130b450457692d64b93150797caac9db29ae37f312aac1a6fc8956.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a94a290608f5e469899cf8ecfc7540a6bc08743121620943ccd4818e62190abe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a60860f9e0a0efcca6669d785e17b76101ebe4bc4fb8dcba70638f4b2cadd683.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b589b0cbc25a0421de01f3e92e8f190dadcc623b3daf76f79dfb43a5a2f75f87.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ce001546e000","dlc":[]}